                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Futura'>This score quantifies the average readmission risk across all patients, derived from historical readmission data. A &apos;Yes&apos; readmission contributes a score of 3, while &apos;No&apos; contributes 0, reflecting the severity of readmission cases within the patient population.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Futura'>Insights:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Futura'>- This metric is crucial for understanding and reducing potentially preventable readmissions, directly impacting healthcare costs and patient outcomes.</run>
