          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Futura' fontsize='11'>This interactive dashboard is designed to assist healthcare providers, administrators, and policy makers in analyzing and understanding the risks associated with patient readmissions across various states. By integrating medical data with social determinants of health (SDoH), the dashboard provides a comprehensive view of factors influencing readmission rates.</run>
